    {
      "id": "en__start-9",
      "label": "Video games and Animation are art…",
      "template": "en__start-9",
      "enabled": true,
      "texts": [
        {
          "key": "text-0",
          "label": "Video games and Animation are art…",
          "value": "Video games and Animation are art…\n"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-1",
          "label": "AI is just the",
          "value": "AI is just the"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-2",
          "label": "TOOL",
          "value": "TOOL "
        },
        {
          "key": "text-3",
          "label": "Poorly used AI",
          "value": "Poorly used AI"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-4",
          "label": "creates voices that don’t fit on screen.",
          "value": "creates voices that don’t fit on screen."
        },
        {
          "key": "text-5",
          "label": "Bad traditional dubbing fails too.",
          "value": "Bad traditional dubbing fails too."
        },
        {
          "key": "text-6",
          "label": "The problem isn’t the technology, but how it’s used.",
          "value": "The problem isn’t the technology, but how it’s used."
        },
        {
          "key": "text-7",
          "label": "Used properly, AI optimizes the process.",
          "value": "Used properly, AI optimizes the process."
        },
        {
          "key": "text-8",
          "label": "It allows you to produce",
          "value": "It allows you to produce "
        },
        {
          "key": "text-9",
          "label": "faster",
          "value": "faster"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-10",
          "label": "and at",
          "value": " and at "
        },
        {
          "key": "text-11",
          "label": "lower cost",
          "value": "lower cost"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-12",
          "label": ".",
          "value": "."
        },
        {
          "key": "text-13",
          "label": "To work across",
          "value": "To work across "
        },
        {
          "key": "text-14",
          "label": "more languages",
          "value": "more languages"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-15",
          "label": ",",
          "value": ","
        },
        {
          "key": "text-16",
          "label": "more characters",
          "value": "more characters"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-17",
          "label": "and",
          "value": "and "
        },
        {
          "key": "text-18",
          "label": "more content",
          "value": "more content"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-19",
          "label": ".",
          "value": "."
        },
        {
          "key": "text-20",
          "label": "It makes projects viable that otherwise wouldn’t be.",
          "value": "It makes projects viable that otherwise wouldn’t be."
        },
        {
          "key": "text-21",
          "label": "Dubbing a video game or animation increases its reach",
          "value": "Dubbing a video game or animation increases its reach"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-22",
          "label": "…",
          "value": "…"
        },
        {
          "key": "text-23",
          "label": "But if the cost of dubbing exceeds the return,",
          "value": "But if the cost of dubbing exceeds the return, "
        },
        {
          "key": "text-24",
          "label": "it stops making sense.",
          "value": "it stops making sense."
        },
        {
          "key": "text-25",
          "label": "The difference isn’t just the method, but how it’s applied.",
          "value": "The difference isn’t just the method, but how it’s applied."
        },
        {
          "key": "text-26",
          "label": "If you want to hear the difference…",
          "value": "If you want to hear the difference…"
        },
        {
